   },
   "7": {
    "original": "The U.S. is so deep that it has three No. 3 attackers - Fischer, Neushul and Grossman.",
    "rewrite": "The U.S. possesses three top-tier attackers with positions similar to No. 3, including Fischer, Neushul, and Grossman."
